# Runtime state for the Career Ops integration.
# Workbooks (backups and acceptance test copies) are never committed.
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*
!.gitignore
!scan-runs/
!scan-runs/*.json
# Department run-health for the Excel workers (tracker writer B08, monthly
# rollover B09). Aggregate only: statuses, row counts, hashes and file names —
# never workbook content, so it is safe to commit as operational evidence.
!run-health/
!run-health/*.json
